.TH PCRE2_SET_RECURSION_MEMORY_MANAGEMENT 3 "23 January 2023" "PCRE2 10.49-DEV"
.SH NAME
pcre2_set_recursion_memory_management - obsolete function that does nothing
.SH SYNOPSIS
.sp
.B #include <pcre2.h>
.PP
.nf
.B int pcre2_set_recursion_memory_management(
.B "      pcre2_match_context *\fImcontext\fP,"
.B "      void *(*\fImymalloc\fP)(size_t \fIsize\fP, void *\fImydata\fP),"
.B "      void (*\fImyfree\fP)(void *\fIptr\fP, void *\fImydata\fP),"
.B "      void *\fImydata\fP);"
.fi
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.sp
From release 10.30 onwards, this function is obsolete and does nothing. The
result is always zero.
.P
There is a complete description of the PCRE2 native API in the
.\" HREF
\fBpcre2api\fP
.\"
page and a description of the POSIX API in the
.\" HREF
\fBpcre2posix\fP
.\"
page.


